# R69 review artefacts that are regenerated, never committed.
#
# sources/  - upstream files read at an immutable version, tag or commit.
#             Third-party source, and bacon 3.25.0 is AGPL-3.0: the owner's
#             2026-09-12 licence ruling does NOT touch the rule against
#             committing third-party copyleft files into this repository.
#             assert-figures.sh re-fetches them automatically.
# target/   - cargo build output from the empirical probes.
# toolcheck/- the scratch --root that bacon-install-check.sh installs into.
evidence/sources/
empirical/toolcheck/
empirical/*/target/
